# Inverted 2026-08-08 (specs/invert-tests-ignore-rule.md): the live gate suite
# ships by default so a fresh clone can run the release gates and their fixture
# self-tests. Only the historical fixture archives below are excluded — they
# are author-only reference, not something the gates need to run.
tests/fixtures/v[0-9]*/
tests/fixtures/phase5/
tests/fixtures/rule11/
# Dormant parallel suite no release gate runs; shipping it is a separate open question (.backlog/decide-scanner-suite-fate.md).
tests/scanner/
# The goal-tripwire fixtures intentionally contain nested .handoffs/ and .prompts/
# directories (they simulate the artifacts that lint checks) — re-include them here
# since the blanket .handoffs/ and .prompts/ excludes above would otherwise swallow
# them too; a file under an excluded directory cannot be re-included on its own.
!tests/fixtures/goal-tripwire/*/.handoffs/
!tests/fixtures/goal-tripwire/*/.handoffs/**
!tests/fixtures/goal-tripwire/*/.prompts/
!tests/fixtures/goal-tripwire/*/.prompts/**
.lint-allowlist
.scanner-exceptions.json
hooks/lib/
